{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "1cbd0043f6221ab03e979b2a779d8091c569f0fd45cbe580239c3d98d813cacc", "ja": "相対する旋律", "zh": "相对的旋律", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bce9a3fcf2d20d249b7bc3835fa620e0fd743a49334bee64bb0fd3122144463e", "ja": "トモカ率いる革命軍と連合軍の決戦が始まる\n中、監獄星へ降り立つチハヤとヒナタ。歌姫\n対決を心の強さで制したチハヤだったが、監\n獄星の崩壊に巻き込まれ絶体絶命。そこへ駆\nけつけたのは、別れたはずのコノミだった！", "zh": "在朋花率领的革命军与联军展开决战之际，千早与日向降落在监狱星。  \n凭借坚强的内心赢得歌姬对决的千早，却被卷入监狱星的崩塌，  \n陷入绝境。就在这时赶来的人，竟然是本应已经分别的木实！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "97009945783866e37171d9ad8bf2d70777360a7223fa7db5b01aab4cdcfa61a7", "ja": "トモカの革命軍が蜂起し、連合軍との戦いが始まった！\nチハヤとヒナタの戦闘艇は単身、監獄星の中心部へ……", "zh": "朋花的革命军起义了，与联军的战斗就此开始！  \n千早和日向的战斗艇独自驶向监狱星的中心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "d31073d62d1f7b7d12e4dfb1231ba266bf567356076da6e4c9374d7ce7cd6418", "ja": "歌は、戦いの道具じゃない……！\nトモカ！　あなたを止めてみせる！", "zh": "歌不是战斗的工具……！\n朋花！我一定会阻止你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "8f9123e08dc29364f6be693001780757ce67fd25f5e23598b79a654890f83e4c", "ja": "ふふ……私は『大いなる星の意志』をねじ伏せたのよ。\nただ操られていただけのあなたが、勝てると思う？", "zh": "呵呵……我可是将『伟大之星的意志』彻底压制住了。\n仅仅是被操纵的你，觉得自己能赢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "76a4198d64ef0d22b74b49acab206cc8c3bd2aae0372ef6d5a074d03af2c3582", "ja": "勝ち負けじゃないわ……\nこの宇宙の平和と大切な人達のため、私は歌うだけ！", "zh": "这不是胜负……\n为了这个宇宙的和平和重要的人们，我只需歌唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "6ccf6923a504244603502b910994e781522a822df5c6fe7121efcebbd9c191a8", "ja": "響け、この旋律！", "zh": "响彻吧，这道旋律！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "6ccf6923a504244603502b910994e781522a822df5c6fe7121efcebbd9c191a8", "ja": "響け、この旋律！", "zh": "响彻吧，这道旋律！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "c4dc317c66fd826a0764a3817fa4d0a3df358341859e4725389e8f5db26ca225", "ja": "革命軍の勢いが、弱まっている……？\nトモカの精神波を、チハヤの歌が打ち消しているのか。", "zh": "革命军的势头正在减弱……？是托莫卡的精神波被千早的歌声抵消了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "66f1f179ef12211a3b42bc5f4dd8ce21276c0dbbb013b57bf77b85e49c3a17b6", "ja": "今のチハヤには、『大いなる星の意志』の\n力はないはず。なのに、なぜだ……？", "zh": "现在的千早，应该没有『伟大星辰的意志』的力量才对。可为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "7a76a440379330ab1eeeabb1c63f743eee5d6b722301b262fd61d112e1b48c84", "ja": "チハヤはね、ただ真っすぐに歌ってるだけなんだ。\nそれが一番、心に届く……きっと、それだけのこと。", "zh": "千早只是直率地歌唱而已。\n但那样最能传达进心里……一定，就只是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a5095cb60725448b45664bcec7b88a862007b33ed210be532fdea28985a4f6a", "ja": "こっちも決着をつけよう、マツリ。\nあんたの戦争は、ここで終わりだ……せやぁーっ！", "zh": "我们这边也来做个了断吧，茉莉。  \n你的战争，就到此为止了……喝啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "b170cbcde904e554c8a2ca1d3b049f3bf34ed0c0f3a59c6252919a5a51b140bc", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\nこんな、はずは……くっ……！", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊、哈啊……  \n不该是这样的……呃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "993bed2961e864b7f875251487a4efbbfd5e2f6f40a6ee85204381220d671a02", "ja": "革命軍は終わりです。ここも、じき崩壊するでしょう。\n……トモカ、一緒に脱出しましょう。", "zh": "革命军已经完了。这里也很快就会崩塌吧。\n……朋花，我们一起逃出去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "7a15ad4ceaac65d721a01d90d06dcc1cf36939fc7c47e7db65deb0dc8fa74221", "ja": "これ以上力を使えば、『大いなる星の意志』に\n呑まれてしまう。そうなる前に、もう一度封印を……！", "zh": "再继续使用力量的话，就会被『伟大的星之意志』吞噬。在那之前，再封印一次……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "a74bef241cc23336cee17f9b4f3c8eb83286bf3884b4724586e5f35175ab8487", "ja": "ふ、ふふっ……私は、誰にも支配などされない！\n私の歌で、必ずこの宇宙を……！", "zh": "不、不会……我绝不会被任何人支配！\n凭我的歌，一定要让这个宇宙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "509f2a70c0c8d545ff4e30d090c7ce8db48c540a748fe99aefce3299cdecae5d", "ja": "行ってはだめ！　トモカ……トモカーッ！", "zh": "不能去！　朋花……朋花——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1016_null", "source_sha256": "3d17ac1e72a87fb4ac01363d942729e0792a7a8fe21b02ccfb653e016631198b", "ja": "トモカとマツリは、崩れゆく瓦礫の中へと消えた。\nチハヤとヒナタも、もう逃げ道はない……。", "zh": "朋花和茉莉消失在不断崩塌的瓦砾中。\n千早和日向也已经无路可逃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "06b87cb889664e26b72b7b672e6e39e2ab8d25f8a0b3634f0535dc4773447824", "ja": "……と、その時！　監獄星の重力圏を貫いて飛来した\n冒険艦『馬場』が、ふたりを救い上げたのだ！", "zh": "……正在此时！贯穿监狱星重力圈飞来的\n冒险舰“马场”号，将两人救了上来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_05_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "49b2991a750ee2b770d77cce975fdef85cc1ee094c807185d63048aef884ede8", "ja": "ふたりとも、ひとつ貸しにしとくわよ？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "你们两个，可都欠我一个人情哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
